<!--
  Only the pages a search engine should actually index.

  Brandora is mostly an authenticated tool once someone has an account — the
  dashboard, the brand book, orders, quotes, the admin and procurement screens
  all carry <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"> and are
  deliberately left out of this file. Listing a page here that the page
  itself asks not to be indexed is the same contradiction a duplicate robots
  tag would be; scripts/check-seo.mjs fails the build if the two ever
  disagree.
-->
